ax |logit difference| / max |logit|); here every changed variable stood in with gain 1 must give M's logits, the error coming from rebuilding W from fp32 pieces (E226's F_from_pieces under 1e-4 relative; the toy check in the plan reads 4e-6 absolute). size_rel: E240's (sum |dW|^2 against the target's; fp32 rounding about 1e-7 relative, a wrong target off by over 1e-2). Exact zeros, no tolerance: every unchanged variable's gain is 1, and every unchanged variable stood in at once adds exact zeros at every site (stand_in docstring). band_min: E226's filed fallback when the split-half band is 0. shard_hours_max: E226's."}
